stmd:evidence-37989538-E01 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E01 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, methods paragraph" ; stm:quote "These numpy arrays, along with the numpy arrays generated by the researchers, were employed to compute sensitivity, specificity, accuracy and the F1 score for both the researchers and the prompts" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E02 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E02 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "Main text, methods paragraph" ; stm:quote "a recently published SR titled ‘Light Therapy in Insomnia Disorder: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis’ was selected, and the databases were queried using the keywords stipulated in the original paper" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E03 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E03 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E04 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E04 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E05 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E05 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, discussion and recommendations" ; stm:quote "However, it is imperative to recognise that GPT is not yet fully capable of independently completing this task and should be employed as an assistant to mitigate the risk of overlooking potential studies" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E06 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E06 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E07 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E07 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "Main text, rationale for choosing the source review" ; stm:quote "reviewers did not face much trouble but models had difficulties with studies that included patients with secondary sleeping troubles like patients with cancer" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E08a a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E08a ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E08b a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E08b ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E08c a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E08c ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E09 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E09 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E10 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E10 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E11 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E11 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, discussion" ; stm:quote "should be employed as an assistant to mitigate the risk of overlooking potential studies" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E12 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E12 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "Main text, recommendations" ; stm:quote "We advise researchers wanting to deploy GPT to manually screen a proportion of titles and abstracts, experiment with different prompts and consider the combination of findings, a method unexplored in our study" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E13 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E13 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, discussion" ; stm:quote "GPT is a potent tool, and we propose its usage in title and abstract screening for SRs, following the method we have delineated in this case report, alongside other researchers" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E14 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E14 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, methods paragraph" ; stm:quote "The code for this process is available at the provided link: https://github.com/mamishere/Article-Relevancy-Extraction-GPT3.5-Turbo" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E15 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E15 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "Main text, introduction" ; stm:quote "GPT-4 has exhibited commendable performance across a range of human-related tasks and has surpassed its predecessor, GPT-3.5, in evaluations conducted by the company" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E16 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E16 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, methods paragraph" ; stm:quote "The labels used as the ‘gold standard’ were the studies included in the selected SR" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E17 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E17 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Repository: https://github.com/mamishere/Article-Relevancy-Extraction-GPT3.5-Turbo, file 'Relevancy Extraction Notebook.ipynb', function generate_prompt" ; stm:quote "model=\"gpt-3.5-turbo\",         messages=[{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": prompt}],         max_tokens=100,         # Set a limit on the response length         temperature=0,          # Set the temperature for randomness (0 means deterministic)" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E18 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E18 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, closing paragraph" ; stm:quote "The prompt texts are available in the online supplemental table 1" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E19 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E19 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, results paragraph" ; stm:quote "Lastly, Prompt 8 introduced a screening tool with four questions, requiring the model to include a study if the answer to all four questions was ‘Yes’ or ‘Unsure" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E20 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E20 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, results paragraph" ; stm:quote "Prompt 1, which replicated the criteria from the original paper, demonstrated 80% accuracy and 62% sensitivity" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E21 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E21 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, results paragraph" ; stm:quote "We also recommend the incorporation of a sentence prioritising inclusivity to guide the model in including unclear studies" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E22 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E22 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E23 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E23 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E24 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E24 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, results paragraph" ; stm:quote "Prompt 7 assessed the impact of phrasing by modifying the language of the previous prompt and providing a more detailed description of the inclusivity phrase" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E25 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E25 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "Main text, methods paragraph" ; stm:quote "The initial search yielded 330 citations, which were subsequently imported into EndNote X20. An RTF file containing titles and abstracts was generated, followed by its conversion into a more compatible TXT format, thus facilitating further data processing" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E26 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E26 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "References, reference 4" ; stm:quote "GPT-4 technical report ; 2023 . Available : https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023arXiv230308774O" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E27 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E27 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "Main text, methods paragraph" ; stm:quote "The integration of the OpenAI GPT 3.5 Turbo API played a pivotal role in advancing our research" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E28 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E28 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, methods paragraph" ; stm:quote "The initial search yielded 330 citations, which were subsequently imported into EndNote X20" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E29 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E29 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "Main text, discussion" ; stm:quote "the lack of clarity in the criteria for ‘sleep troubles’ resulted in substantial bias in the model’s performance and significant disparities among researchers" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E30 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E30 ; stm:status "present" ; stm:location "Main text, methods paragraph" ; stm:quote "The integration of the OpenAI GPT 3.5 Turbo API played a pivotal role in advancing our research. This powerful tool enabled us to initiate requests to evaluate the pertinence of prompts to individual papers" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E31 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E31 ; stm:status "partial" ; stm:location "Main text, closing paragraphs" ; stm:quote "It needs to be acknowledged that the findings of this single-case study are not generalisable, and each study objective necessitates its distinct format" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E32 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E32 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
stmd:evidence-37989538-E33 a stm:EvidenceItem ; stm:field stmd:field-E33 ; stm:status "absent" ; stm:location "not found" .
